es</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three hours of gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Four endings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 original CGs;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Original music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hope you will enjoy playing it!</i> </p>",
